            "text_2": "<p>We will incorporate meaningful material from your organization and preserve it into your custom pieces i.e. material from a historic building, fabric from seats, wood from floors.  You name it, we've done it!</p>",
            "image_3": "shopify://shop_images/3_bd159e28-d6d8-44a2-a09f-eb38e354fdc1.png",
            "heading_3": "Option 3: Mural Making",
            "text_3": "<p>We will create an immersive mural making experience with your team.  The mural will reveal a hidden message at the end that can be repurposed into the gift. Watch the video to learn more.</p>",
