            "link_color": "#c81688",
            "icon_1": "shopify://shop_images/D212BDC1-6114-457B-B7D7-1132EF76A3FE.webp",
            "text_1": "<p><strong>Bottle Stoppers</strong><br/>Custom bottle stoppers using the company colors for the graffiti and engraved on the back. This made for a perfect holiday gifts for clients. </p>",
            "icon_2": "shopify://shop_images/F90A2042-5B8D-421C-82BA-4564B044C88B_1.webp",
            "text_2": "<p><strong>Ornaments</strong><br/>Custom ornament made for the centennial celebration for Downtown Detroit Partnership. The logo incorporated graffiti in the colors of the organization. </p>",
            "icon_3": "shopify://shop_images/PhotoRoom_000_20230315_143446.webp",
            "text_3": "<p><strong>Custom Bracelet</strong><br/>Created in partnership with DTE to celebrate the young women at Munger school who participated in a STEM program. The bracelets are made from DTE vests provided by the Company.</p>",
            "icon_4": "shopify://shop_images/Custom_notebook_Slide_4_1.webp",
            "text_4": "<p><strong>Custom Journal</strong><br/>Eco-friendly journals made from repurposed stone. The bezel contains remnants from a team building mural making experience.</p>"
          },
